body:
Hi! I have a documentation issue on InstantSearch.js. I could not find what I was looking for on the page "[priceRanges](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/v2/widgets/priceRanges.html)".

I am trying to implement code for priceRanges but i am getting error. 

"AlgoliaSearchError: Invalid syntax for numeric condition:price0NaN\n  "

here is my code-

search.addWidget(
	instantsearch.widgets.priceRanges({
		container: '#facet-price',
		attributeName: 'price',
		collapsible: {
			collapsed: is_collapsed
		},
		labels: {
			currency: '$',
			separator: 'to',
			button: 'Go'
		},
		templates: {
			header: '<h3 class="widgettitle">Price</h3>'
		}
	})
);
